OL,3,GNEWSASmoke control area expanded to
OL,4,Awhole city
OL,5,
OL,6,FHouseholds across the whole of York are
OL,7,Fnow covered by a smoke control area,
OL,8,Fthe council has said.
OL,10,FThe rules, which limit the way
OL,11,Fresidents use wood-burning stoves, aim
OL,12,Fto improve air quality and protect
OL,13,Fpeople's health.
OL,15,FPreviously, about 80% of the city was
OL,16,Fcovered by a smoke control area which
OL,17,Fhas now been expanded to the whole of
OL,18,FYork.
OL,20,FThe council said the expansion would
OL,21,Fmake the rules "easier to understand"
OL,22,Fand "reduce preventable deaths".
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
